# ==============================================================================
# VitalBook Monorepo Environment Configuration Index
# ==============================================================================
# We use Framework-Native Cascading + Zero-Disk Production Secrets.
# Never commit real credentials to git.
#
# Local Development:
# 1. Web (Next.js):     apps/web/.env.example     -> apps/web/.env.local
# 2. API (Laravel):     apps/api/.env.example     -> apps/api/.env
# 3. Mobile (Flutter):  apps/mobile/.env.example  -> apps/mobile/.env
#
# Production:
# Variables are injected in-memory at runtime via CI/CD, Netlify, and Cloud ECS.
# ==============================================================================
